WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.152 --> 00:00:01.110
SAAD ALI: Hi, everyone.

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:04.130
We're here in sunny
Barcelona for KubeCon EU.

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:06.410
This is the largest
KubeCon so far,

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:08.660
and the biggest
KubeCon in Europe.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:10.140
We have a lot of
Googlers with us,

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.140
and we're going to be
bringing you live coverage

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:15.350
throughout the week,
including recaps of talks,

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:17.300
as well as interviews
with influencers.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.640
Subscribe to the GCP
channel, and stay

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:21.560
tuned for a lot of content.

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.910
[MUSIC PLAYING]

